{
  "command": "get_config",
  "note": "Fetched live from the reader via AWS IoT (FXR60-LAB/mcmd -> FXR60-LAB/mrsp) after the connection was confirmed working. This is the reader's own confirmed-working AWS cloudConfig, not a hand-built payload.",
